  "releaseNotes": "v5.2.5 - WebGPU: an EMPTY view is legal, so stop binding zero bytes. A zero-length storage binding invalidated the whole CommandBuffer, so one legitimately empty tensor (ONNX uses them for \"no padding\"; a Slice can select nothing) killed every dispatch batched with it. 4-byte floors on allocation and binding; the view still reports Length 0.",
